WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.270
Operational conversations and delivery status share one workspace. No business number is connected.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:12.990
Within the sample service window, staff can simulate a specific operational reply.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:19.190
When the service window is closed, a relevant approved template is required.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:25.430
The template preview appears in the conversation. This demonstration sends no external message.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:32.190
An opt-out blocks further messages, including automated retries.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:37.510
Review the failure, consent and duplicate checks before retrying. Delivery is never guaranteed.

